{"id":"91faecc96ddef326","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-gls-decidable.md","title":"Decidability of GLS","display":"cor-gls-decidable — Decidability of GLS","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-gls-decidable","aliases":["89-cor-gls-decidable"],"display":"cor-gls-decidable — Decidability of GLS","depends_on":["[[89-thm-gls-completeness]]","[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-gls-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-gls-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gls-decidable — Decidability of GLS"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e926c452321080c\" href=\"?note=9e926c452321080c\" title=\"89-thm-gls-completeness\">89-thm-gls-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3bbdf6f3419b5805\" href=\"?note=3bbdf6f3419b5805\" title=\"89-df-gl-algorithm\">89-df-gl-algorithm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为已有有界反模型判定算法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\mapsto A^s\">\\(A\\mapsto A^s\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLS}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLS}\\)</span> 是仅对 MP 闭合的反射逻辑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GLS}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GLS}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是本条定义的判定函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gls\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nd_{\\mathrm{GLS}}(A)\\coloneqq d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A^s),\\qquad\nd_{\\mathrm{GLS}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLS}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gls\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nd_{\\mathrm{GLS}}(A)\\coloneqq d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A^s),\\qquad\nd_{\\mathrm{GLS}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLS}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 131–132；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限反射伴随式的构造终止，GL 的有界反模型搜索终止，因此其复合判定 GLS。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-gls-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"9e926c452321080c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gls-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\mapsto A^s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLS}","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{GLS}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gls\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nd_{\\mathrm{GLS}}(A)\\coloneqq d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A^s),\\qquad\nd_{\\mathrm{GLS}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLS}.","display":true}],"bytes":1047,"backlinks":[{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-cor-gls-decidable]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]] → [[89-lem-solovay-limit-properties]] → [[89-lem-solovay-truth]] → [[89-lem-solovay-lem2]] → [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-companion]] → [[89-thm-gls-completeness]] → [[89-cor-gls-decidable]] → [[89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["9e926c452321080c","3bbdf6f3419b5805"]}